  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The angry chef screams at his lazy kitchen staff for leaving a dirty plate. He orders everyone to clean the kitchen immediately while they secretly plot to calm him down with a special spiked drink.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ну что за инвалиды?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какой идиот тарелку здесь оставил?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Мне что, за всем следить надо?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "У вас есть полчаса, чтобы всё убрать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "angelina",
   "t": "Совсем крыша у него поехала.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "angelina",
   "t": "Надо ему срочно дать выпить.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Да как? Тут же камеры кругом.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ну, кто там ещё пришёл?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Шеф, хотите выпить чайку?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какой к чёрту чай?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пошли вон, я вам сказал!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Шеф, ну попробуйте этот чай.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Шеф, вам обязательно понравится.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let us break down this interaction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ну что за инвалиды?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What a bunch of idiots?' -- ENG The furious chef yells at his incompetent kitchen workers.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какой идиот тарелку здесь оставил?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Which idiot left a plate here?' -- ENG He points at a dirty dish left carelessly on the counter.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Мне что, за всем следить надо?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do I have to keep an eye on everything?' -- ENG He complains about having to constantly supervise his adult employees.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "У вас есть полчаса, чтобы всё убрать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You have half an hour to clean everything.' -- ENG He issues a strict deadline for them to tidy up.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "angelina",
   "t": "Совсем крыша у него поехала.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'His roof has completely slid off.' -- ENG One cook whispers that their boss has lost his mind.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "angelina",
   "t": "Надо ему срочно дать выпить.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We need to urgently give him a drink.' -- ENG They realize that alcohol is the only way to calm him down.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Да как? Тут же камеры кругом.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But how? There are cameras all around here.' -- ENG The sous-chef worries about being caught on the security footage.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ну, кто там ещё пришёл?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well, who else came there?' -- ENG The chef hears someone approaching and turns around aggressively.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Шеф, хотите выпить чайку?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Chef, do you want to drink some tea?' -- ENG Lyova politely offers him a warm beverage spiked with alcohol.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Какой к чёрту чай?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What the hell kind of tea?' -- ENG The boss rejects the innocent drink with extreme prejudice.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пошли вон, я вам сказал!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Get out, I told you!' -- ENG He angrily orders the sous-chef to leave the room immediately.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Шеф, ну попробуйте этот чай.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Chef, please try this tea.' -- ENG Lyova bravely insists that he takes a sip of the drink.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anja",
   "t": "Шеф, вам обязательно понравится.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
